WEBVTT

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:45.620
BLADE OF THE IMMORTAL

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:48.130
One, two, three

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:52.670
Undead tree

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:54.840
What truth

00:00:56.090 --> 00:00:58.550
I'll come true

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:05.690
Wow...

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:09.570
I see that bright light

00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:15.950
This is all I have

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:20.450
What did you say?
I know

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:25.000
Why do you say?

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:30.670
Hone the blade lie around

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:37.640
Survive of vision
Death and pleasure are my future

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:41.720
I got lost
I was lost

00:01:42.010 --> 00:01:45.480
Survive of vision

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:48.770
Unfinished heaven

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:52.530
Now fight to claim your wounds

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:56.280
Don't know why
Don't know why

00:01:56.900 --> 00:02:01.080
Survive of vision

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:11.790
-One, two! One, two!
-Hey, fellas. Stop for a second.

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:22.970
There's no sound of talking...

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:24.770
I think we're going the wrong way.

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:28.140
The Tenpo dojo, was it?

00:02:28.230 --> 00:02:30.020
Just leave it to us.

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:33.860
Trust me, we'll be there before you can even yawn.

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:41.820
That was kind of a letdown.

00:02:41.910 --> 00:02:45.040
It's as they say. No matter how skilled
a swordsman you are, there's no way

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:47.830
you can avoid a raid at dawn or a sneak attack.

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:57.970
The members of the Itto-ryu

00:02:58.050 --> 00:03:01.390
are really just a gathering of paupers.

00:03:01.470 --> 00:03:04.180
Like tattoo artists and mask-selling fathers.

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:07.350
You'll find people from every walk of life.

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:11.310
But this is the first time I've seen
basket-bearing swordsmen.

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:12.730
That's incredible.

00:03:12.810 --> 00:03:14.570
Stop messing around.

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:16.110
Hey, you punk!

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:18.650
Being a strong swordsman doesn't make you great!

00:03:20.110 --> 00:03:22.990
If you were to flee right now I wouldn't chase you.

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:24.280
Can we go that route?

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:26.040
The heck are you talking about?

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:30.000
Your blade is stuck deep in my partner over there!

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:33.670
His body's gone stiff, you won't be
pulling that out so easily.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:36.500
That is true.

00:03:43.470 --> 00:03:46.510
You'd think a guy with a weapon built into his carriage

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:50.310
would be more wary of others carrying hidden weapons.

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:54.480
I missed your vitals, but it looks like it stings.

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:58.190
Want to see a doctor?

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:01.950
Then tell me.

00:04:02.030 --> 00:04:04.110
Who sent you?

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:09.540
Don't try and fool me saying you're
after revenge for your disgraced dojo.

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:12.670
If I leave you, you'll bleed out and die.

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:14.420
If you tell me, I'll save you.

00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:18.590
You've got about an hour.

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:22.470
Ka...gi...

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:27.180
Ka...

00:04:28.430 --> 00:04:30.560
-g...
-Akagi?

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:33.810
Hey!

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:41.610
Sorry. I guess I did hit a vital organ.

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:54.870
TENPO

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:56.330
Mr. Magatsu!

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:58.840
Did you walk here?

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:00.090
Yeah pretty much.

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:03.300
There's blood on your hands...

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:04.720
Don't mind it.

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:07.390
More importantly, whose weapon is that?

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:08.300
This...

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:17.270
Pardon.

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:24.860
Makoto. Who is that?

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:28.320
That's Kagimura Habaki,
a member of the Daimyo's guard.

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:33.620
What do the authorities want?

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:36.500
They're from Shinagawa.

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:39.840
Fusano and Morozumi
have been named proxy instructors.

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:40.750
And?

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:42.500
One month from now,

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:45.470
the Itto-ryu will become a clan
retained by the Shogunate.

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:56.520
You could at least give me your name.

00:05:56.600 --> 00:05:58.850
-Mine is--
-I'm aware.

00:05:58.940 --> 00:06:01.730
Chogo Morozumi of the Itto-ryu.

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:02.980
Without a doubt.

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:05.190
An assassin? Who hired you?

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:13.160
There's something I want to ask.

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:17.500
How many members of the Itto-ryu
have the title "instructor"?

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:20.210
The number of instructors.

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:22.090
Like I'd tell you...

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:23.800
If you don't, I will kill you.

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:32.600
There are no...

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:35.180
instructors in the Itto-ryu.

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:39.060
Though, the ones with skill second only to our leader,

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:41.860
as far as I know, number 30.

00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:44.480
Thirty of them? Is this true?

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:47.530
Now hurry up, take this off.

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:48.490
I see.

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:51.780
I'm sorry.

00:06:58.120 --> 00:07:00.500
To be done in by so little poison...

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:03.880
Your stomach isn't as well-honed as your arm.

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:05.380
How?

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:09.470
We drank the same sake!

00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:11.470
Itto-ryu vice-captain.

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:12.510
Ken'ei Fusano.

00:07:13.890 --> 00:07:16.930
Formerly a low ranking constable.
Went broke and disbanded.

00:07:17.020 --> 00:07:19.310
Changed your name and joined the Itto-ryu.

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:21.270
An unmatched womanizer.

00:07:21.350 --> 00:07:23.610
Does that sound about right?

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:25.900
Where did you learn all...?

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:28.860
A rat?

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:34.620
Even if my arms and legs are hampered...
Just because you're a woman--

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:41.960
Fool.

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:45.380
Women can do the job too.

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:52.130
Are you okay, Hyakurin?

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:54.680
Such a surprise attack is too easy for--

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:01.560
What in the world is it?

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:05.400
I had to drink some of the poison.

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:09.440
So I drank half a liter of sesame oil beforehand.

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:10.780
Amazing!

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:13.610
A fine display of devotion, as usual.

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:16.240
What do you mean "as usual"?

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:29.170
In recent days, sword schools have become
extremely weak.

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:31.550
For that reason, I propose

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:36.090
the establishment of a martial arts organization
called Kobusho.

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:37.220
Kobusho?

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:40.770
For the model to succeed, first,

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:42.310
a series of dojos must be built,

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:44.980
to which dozens of Itto-ryu members

00:08:45.060 --> 00:08:47.810
will be invited as instructors.

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:51.280
I see.

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:54.450
It's no wonder the official's movements
were so slow.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:56.280
Have we been overlooked?

00:08:58.030 --> 00:08:59.950
Isn't that a good deal?

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:03.120
With this you're cleared and can be reinstated
as a military family.

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:08.210
Yes. That's right.

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:09.960
It's our victory.

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:15.930
Listen...

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:18.430
Do you mind if I hop off at this point?

00:09:18.510 --> 00:09:20.180
What's your reason?

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:23.930
My heart found its satisfaction
in crushing those dojos.

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:27.600
I don't hate your way of thinking.

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:31.440
But I'm me. I won't join with samurai.

00:09:32.690 --> 00:09:35.320
You won't stain your sword?

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:39.120
Such a fragile fence that surrounds
the followers of a school.

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:42.620
The Itto-ryu especially, right?

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:46.330
Say hi to everyone for me.

00:09:47.460 --> 00:09:50.040
I won't try to stop you as I think it's pointless,

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:53.760
but you may continue to use Yukimachi's second floor
as you like.

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:55.800
I appreciate it.

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.180
Oh, that's right.

00:09:57.260 --> 00:10:01.390
Master, do you recall inviting the loathing
of a guy named "Akagi"?

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:03.390
No. I don't remember him.

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:05.310
Be careful.

00:10:05.390 --> 00:10:08.350
It's up to you what to do with the Itto-ryu,

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:11.940
but the world has its ways of hammering down
the nails that stick out.

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:15.240
That pains me to hear. I'll keep it in mind.

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:17.240
That's all then.

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:18.200
See you.

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:29.540
You didn't tell me you were going out.

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:33.130
That's why I told you just now.

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:35.050
Was this all I brought?

00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:36.050
Hey!

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:42.600
I left the Itto-ryu, so I can't stay in that the room anymore.

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:45.100
Did Mr. Kage tell you that?

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:47.730
No. I decided it.

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:49.310
Who's going to guard this place?

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:53.110
Idiot, you make me sound like a pimp.

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:54.690
You don't want to be a pimp?

00:10:55.900 --> 00:10:57.610
Come on now.

00:10:57.690 --> 00:11:00.070
I'll take care of you.

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:01.990
Cut it out.

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:05.240
Come on, Mr. Tai!

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:06.620
Come on!

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:08.290
You're getting on my nerves.

00:11:14.090 --> 00:11:15.630
Mr. Tai...

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:21.180
When I say "I'm cold," you sleep in my futon with me,

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:24.720
but you've never actually laid a hand on me.

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:27.310
Am I that unattractive?

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:29.350
Do you hate women who sell their bodies?

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:32.730
Is it because I look like your younger sister?

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:35.570
You don't resemble her one bit.

00:11:35.650 --> 00:11:36.650
But

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:39.650
when she was alive, she was probably about your height.

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:41.860
I can't get aroused by someone like you.

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:46.790
-Let go!
-How about that?

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:48.450
-Cut it out!
-Don't think I will.

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:49.540
YUKIMACHI

00:11:55.670 --> 00:11:58.170
What'll you do now that you've left the Itto-ryu?

00:11:58.260 --> 00:12:00.170
What do you mean?

00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:03.510
I suppose I might go somewhere and hone my skills.

00:12:05.470 --> 00:12:06.760
You know...

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:09.680
in about two years,

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:11.440
I'll be able to leave Yukimachi.

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:15.110
I'm doing this stuff now so I can pay for
my mother's medicine...

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:17.650
But the doctor said

00:12:17.730 --> 00:12:20.320
she likely only has two years left.

00:12:21.530 --> 00:12:25.200
It's my dream to share a house with someone.

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:28.450
The day my parent dies

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:31.120
and the man I love runs away from me,
I'll...

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:34.750
Ren...

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:37.290
It's okay. You can be rid of me.

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:41.210
You are a swordsman after all, Mr. Tai.

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:45.390
You couldn't be with a woman whose dream it is
to own a house.

00:12:45.470 --> 00:12:48.600
You couldn't. I'd slow you down.

00:12:50.640 --> 00:12:52.980
But for all your talk of hating samurai...

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:55.020
You can't...

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:57.560
throw away your sword.

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:04.950
Mr. Tai.

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:09.950
You can have this.

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:14.410
Be well, Ren.

00:13:25.300 --> 00:13:27.590
I'll come hang out from time to time.

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:30.470
Okay! Okay!

00:13:33.850 --> 00:13:35.140
Miss Ren,

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:36.850
a customer!

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:37.980
All right!

00:13:46.610 --> 00:13:48.530
You're late.

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:50.160
Did something happen?

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:51.910
I screwed up.

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:55.210
He left just a moment ago.

00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:56.830
Where is he headed?

00:13:56.920 --> 00:13:59.670
Some sort of journey with no destination.

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:02.210
Well, it's not a rush job,

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:05.220
so let's just take our time and play it by ear.

00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:06.170
I suppose.

00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:10.800
You killed someone?

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:12.760
Shira, you...

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:17.190
The girl I called over wouldn't talk, so...

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:18.690
What?

00:14:18.770 --> 00:14:22.270
You shouldn't mind one or two whores.

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:24.900
Neither of us are amateurs.

00:14:24.990 --> 00:14:28.860
I think the logical thing to do is focus on
our number-one job.

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:32.080
Let's proceed without complaining about how
it gets done.

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:47.720
Ta...

00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:50.010
Tai...

00:14:51.010 --> 00:14:52.970
Mr. Tai...

00:15:04.070 --> 00:15:05.280
Kagehisa...

00:15:07.570 --> 00:15:09.030
Kagehisa...

00:15:10.110 --> 00:15:12.240
I will kill Kagehisa Anotsu.

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:16.290
I've decided.

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:19.500
Little Rin,

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:21.880
what have you been doing until now?

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:25.710
I'm sorry. Of course that was my intention
from the start.

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:28.630
It's just, my resolve...

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:32.090
You feel like you've found it?

00:15:34.720 --> 00:15:36.600
The one I hate is Kagehisa Anotsu.

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:38.480
But

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:42.270
when someone gets in the way, it turns into a fight.

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:44.480
With someone's relatives too.

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:48.070
To be able to smile as you're tread on by others...

00:15:48.150 --> 00:15:50.110
If you're not someone like that,

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:54.370
then no matter who you are, you're made to incur
peoples' resentment.

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:59.330
If you're always afraid of resentment,
you'll never do anything worthwhile.

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:02.920
Yours may be a simple grudge over losing your parents,

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:05.170
but you can hold your head high.

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:08.300
You're right.

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:11.800
Father and Mother are important to me.

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:14.840
Much more than some random stranger.

00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:18.640
Wait... Is it okay to say stuff like that?

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:20.520
Of course it's okay.

00:16:20.600 --> 00:16:22.060
Idiot.

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:25.810
Okay, I've decided!

00:16:28.610 --> 00:16:31.610
I think I'm too weak right now.

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:33.570
My skill as well as my heart.

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:36.160
Thanks to that, I got some innocent kid involved.

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:40.830
Starting today you'd better not hold back.

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:42.250
Idiocy.

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:44.460
If I don't hold back, you'll cry.

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:47.500
I won't cry. You can beat me up real good.

00:16:47.590 --> 00:16:51.260
In exchange, I'll give it my all as well.

00:16:55.390 --> 00:16:57.180
There goes...

00:16:58.600 --> 00:17:01.060
The dragonfly...

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:05.350
To the mountain...

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:06.560
In the distance...

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:07.860
Did I hit your head?

00:17:12.320 --> 00:17:14.450
No matter how much talent you have,

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:17.280
you don't improve in just two or three days.

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:21.080
Especially in your case when the talent's
existence is in question.

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:23.710
Throw yourself at it like this and you'll give out.

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:25.040
But...

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:28.250
there isn't much time left before Kagehisa Anotsu
stands at Kaga.

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:29.710
Exactly,

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:33.010
and if we make it through that,
it's not like that's the end.

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:37.930
Rin, once you've chilled your body,
start up a fire.

00:17:38.010 --> 00:17:40.680
I'll go buy some corn from over there.

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:41.930
Okay.

00:17:53.740 --> 00:17:56.280
Sorry, it's not ready yet--

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:04.950
I heard the little sister was dead.

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:07.080
So then who are you?

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:08.580
Same to you.

00:18:08.670 --> 00:18:09.750
Who--?

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:18.220
It really ticks me off, getting lip from a kid.

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:20.550
Where is Manji?

00:18:20.640 --> 00:18:22.100
I don't know.

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:23.890
What was that, you little...?

00:18:23.970 --> 00:18:26.140
Behind you.

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:29.480
Who and from where are you?

00:18:38.240 --> 00:18:39.700
Mugai-ryu?

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:42.240
Never heard of them.

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:45.580
Well, to be frank,

00:18:45.660 --> 00:18:48.500
we're trying to crush the Itto-ryu.

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:51.290
Well...

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:54.840
There's only one thing that needs be done.

00:18:54.920 --> 00:18:56.210
They may be the Itto-ryu,

00:18:56.300 --> 00:19:00.590
but they're like a paper tiger now,
scattered to many dojos.

00:19:04.930 --> 00:19:08.980
Kagehisa Anotsu will leave for Kaga in a week.

00:19:09.060 --> 00:19:10.060
We know.

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:11.940
But, Mr. Manji,

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:14.110
with you on the run from the law,

00:19:14.190 --> 00:19:16.900
there's not a snowball's chance you'll be given a pass.

00:19:17.940 --> 00:19:21.110
No one said I would leave Edo to chase him.

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:26.740
I'd like to have it all settled by the gates to Yotsuya.

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:30.080
You think he'll make such an irrational move?

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:32.710
In any case,

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:34.790
it's always good to have numbers.

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:38.460
Could I consider you an ally? And then

00:19:38.550 --> 00:19:40.760
join forces?

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:57.610
Morning.

00:20:01.070 --> 00:20:01.950
Um...

00:20:02.030 --> 00:20:03.450
If it's about Manji,

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:07.450
he went to town saying he'd pick up the sword
he took for sharpening.

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:10.790
He said to eat breakfast without him.

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:17.050
First time eating boar meat?

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:21.090
I bought them while you were still asleep.

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:25.930
Boar. Even more revitalizing than fish or corn.

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:35.190
It's good.

00:20:40.900 --> 00:20:43.280
Mr. Shira, you must be pretty strong.

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:45.820
Huh? Of course.

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:47.910
How did you get strong?

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:53.040
Well, I've been killing people

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:55.670
for money since I was 16 years old.

00:20:56.710 --> 00:21:02.050
You're full-fledged when keeping a running tally
becomes too much trouble.

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:03.010
How horrible...

00:21:04.970 --> 00:21:05.800
See here,

00:21:05.890 --> 00:21:07.760
take this for example.

00:21:07.850 --> 00:21:09.760
This was once a boar.

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:12.230
Do you know anyone who would pity it

00:21:12.310 --> 00:21:15.440
and call me cruel because I killed and ate it?

00:21:16.730 --> 00:21:20.020
But, man, now that I've tried this, it really is tasty!

00:21:20.110 --> 00:21:22.320
Plus it gives you energy.

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:27.160
Calling it cruel or whatever just makes things boring.

00:21:27.240 --> 00:21:30.660
It all depends on whether it becomes a part
of your flesh and blood.

00:21:33.370 --> 00:21:35.620
I can't sympathize

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:38.000
with your way of thinking at all.

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:40.920
But if I can become strong,

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:43.090
I'll do the same.

00:21:43.170 --> 00:21:44.880
Good, well said.

00:21:44.970 --> 00:21:47.430
In that case, I'm sure this is fine too.

00:22:00.730 --> 00:22:03.820
No matter how good it tasted, that wasn't boar!

00:22:03.900 --> 00:22:05.530
Not with my wallet!

00:22:20.330 --> 00:22:23.340
Always the same with women.

00:23:49.340 --> 00:23:54.890
ACT SEVEN - EVIL'S SHADOW
